---
// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09ThreeLines
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp9-lines">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 350" role="img" aria-label="A vertical price scale for the assumed account: buy at 200M with ratio 50%; call line at 153.85M, a 23.08% fall, ratio 35%; force-sell line at 142.86M, a 28.57% fall, ratio 30%; wipe-out at 100M, a 50% fall, ratio 0%.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Where the three lines sit on the price (debt 100M, shares bought at 200M)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ba đường nằm ở đâu trên giá (nợ 100 triệu, mua 200 triệu cổ phiếu)</tspan></text><rect x="110" y="60" width="16" height="120.00040000000001" class="feq"/><rect x="110" y="180.0004" width="16" height="28.571399999999983" class="fgold"/><rect x="110" y="208.5718" width="16" height="111.4282" class="feqr"/><line x1="104" y1="60" x2="132" y2="60" class="ln"/><text x="98" y="64" class="b" text-anchor="end">200M</text><DiagramIcon name="ok" x={160} y={60} size={22} /><text x="190" y="58" class="ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy: 200M of shares, ratio 50%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua: 200 triệu cổ phiếu, tỷ lệ 50%</tspan></text><text x="190" y="75" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Your equity 100M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn của bạn 100 triệu</tspan></text><line x1="104" y1="180.0004" x2="132" y2="180.0004" class="ln"/><text x="98" y="184.0004" class="b" text-anchor="end">153.85M</text><DiagramIcon name="warning" x={160} y={172.0004} size={22} /><text x="190" y="170.0004" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>Call line, ratio 35%: shares at 153.85M (−23.08%)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đường báo gọi, tỷ lệ 35%: cổ phiếu 153,85 triệu (−23,08%)</tspan></text><text x="190" y="187.0004" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity 53.85M, 46.2% of it gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn 53,85 triệu, đã mất 46,2%</tspan></text><line x1="104" y1="208.5718" x2="132" y2="208.5718" class="ln"/><text x="98" y="212.5718" class="b" text-anchor="end">142.86M</text><DiagramIcon name="stop" x={160} y={236.5718} size={22} /><text x="190" y="234.5718" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>Force-sell line, ratio 30%: shares at 142.86M (−28.57%)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đường bán giải chấp, tỷ lệ 30%: cổ phiếu 142,86 triệu (−28,57%)</tspan></text><text x="190" y="251.5718" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity 42.86M, 57.1% of it gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn 42,86 triệu, đã mất 57,1%</tspan></text><line x1="104" y1="320" x2="132" y2="320" class="ln"/><text x="98" y="324" class="b" text-anchor="end">100M</text><DiagramIcon name="fail" x={160} y={320} size={22} /><text x="190" y="318" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>Wipe-out, ratio 0%: shares at 100M (−50%)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mất sạch vốn, tỷ lệ 0%: cổ phiếu 100 triệu (−50%)</tspan></text><text x="190" y="335" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>The shares only cover the debt; below this you owe the broker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu chỉ đủ trả nợ; thấp hơn nữa là bạn nợ công ty chứng khoán</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Price at a given ratio r: V = D ÷ (1 − r). Ratios from the MBS policy of 24/09/2025 (call 35%, force-sell 30%).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá tại tỷ lệ r: V = D ÷ (1 − r). Các tỷ lệ lấy từ chính sách MBS ngày 24/09/2025 (gọi 35%, xử lý 30%).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp9-lines { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp9-lines .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp9-lines svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp9-lines text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp9-lines .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-lines .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-lines .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-lines .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp9-lines .g { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-1); }
  .sbp9-lines .ok { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-lines .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp9-lines .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-lines .boxg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-lines .boxok { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-lines .fdebt { fill: var(--border); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp9-lines .feq { fill: var(--act-2); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-lines .feqr { fill: var(--red); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-lines .fgold { fill: var(--gold); fill-opacity: 0.9; }
  .sbp9-lines .fgray { fill: var(--text-muted); fill-opacity: 0.55; }
  .sbp9-lines .wh { fill: var(--bg); }
  .sbp9-lines .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-lines .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-lines .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-lines .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sbp9-lines .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-lines .dotr { fill: var(--red); } .sbp9-lines .dotg { fill: var(--gold); } .sbp9-lines .dotk { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-lines figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
